  "comment": "To the South is a zine about friendship as a way of learning how to live.  Through personal writing and photographs made by a group of friends taken during a day trip to a river in south of Yogyakarta, To the South considers friendship, adulthood, care, and the importance of making space for moments of play in between work and responsibility.",
